alone was missing 28 entries, so a truncation would have lost surfaces) + the new SharedSurfaces\BatteryDelta.Model.cs
link = 997 unique, 0 duplicates, single <Project>/<ItemGroup> pair, on-disk XML validates. PropertyGroup +
PackageReference (3) + ProjectReference (2) + Content (3) preserved verbatim. Same remediation as the accepted
